Content:
Guga:
1. Studies the recipes;
2. Learns their history;
3. Does his best to execute them with precision, respecting the layers of flavor and ingredients.

We: look in admiration, wishing we could taste one of his creations, because we know how good he is

Angel: destroys the complexity of flavor by removing 50 to 80% of the dish and turns it into plain bread and meat  because his palate got stuck at the age of 5. What a freaking waste
